title: AWS CloudWatch API Counter
agents: aws
catalog: cloud/aws
license: WTFPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check forecasts monthly AWS CloudWatch API usage based on current
 consumption and configuration. It calculates the expected API calls until
 the end of the month using the formula:
 forecast = current_aws_total + (remaining_days x daily_calls)

 The check helps you stay within the AWS Free Tier limit of 1 million
 GetMetricStatistics requests per month.

 Thresholds can be configured for warning and critical states based on
 the forecasted percentage of the free tier limit.

discovery:
 One service is created if CloudWatch API counter data is available.
